{"id":"steam-1166040","steam":1166040,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Battle Round","summary":"BattleRound is a quick paced and easy-going game. Play with an assortment of captivating characters and utilize boundless strategies to gain the advantage over your opponents - A compelling battlefield from beginning to end, will begin now!","about":"Special Resources of Tuaroon continent, Mana Stone\r\nAmong the stones, Mana stones are a powerful source of ultimate energy.\r\nBut all the technicians who refined the stone were massacred.\r\nNow the heroes are caught in an endless battle take over the refinery facility left behind.\r\n\r\n\nGame Features\n\r\nBattleRound is Fighting game, which is multiplayer based where teams of 2v2 or 5v5 fight each other for supremacy on a map.\r\nChoose your character among the more than 30 of characters and join the Arena! Defeat the opposing team and kill they to win!\r\n\r\n\nEasy for everyone!\n\r\nIt is not difficult at all. In 3 minutes anyone can learn most of BattleRound\r\nBattleRound has a simple UI for the player to play the game,\r\nSimple VR controller and Non-target skill use system, so anyone can easily adapt to the game.\r\n\r\n\nFast-paced!\n\r\nYou can use all the skills from the beginning, and a game's playtime is less than 5 minutes.\r\nSo very tense kind of matching will be on from the beginning.\r\n\r\n\nInfinite Strategy\n\r\nYou can use a variety of skills and abilities without being restrained by their class and roles.  Create unlimited strategies by using unexpected combinations of skills and equips!\r\n\r\n\nNow, it’s time to join Arena! \n\r\nTake the victory at BattleRound, enjoy the fast-paced creative team tactics that combines action-intensive, intuitive skills!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166040/library_600x900.jpg?t=1575181200","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1166040/header.jpg?t=1575181200","banner"